'''Mr. Angel''' (ミスターエンジェル, ''Misutā Enjeru'', '''Mr. Angel''') is an [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] variant of [[Trolly Blogger]] that appears in [[Legend Stages]] and [[The Aku Realms]]. He was added in [[Version 5.1 Update|Version 5.1]]. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he was added in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.6 Update|Patch 1.0.6]].

