|name = Mr. Angel
|image = E 254.png
|first appearance = '''SoL''': [[Renewed Conflict|Sub-chapter 29 - Renewed Conflict]]<br>
'''Aku Realms''': [[Greece (Aku Realm)|Greece/Shiga]]
