==Enemy==
Mr. Angel is quite fast and can [[Weaken|weaken]] your cats with his Area Attacks, but has rather low health and damage, with 8 knockbacks. Most units can deal with him rather quickly. However, due to his many knockbacks and that this enemy comes en masse most of the times, a single powerful hit is favored over multiple weaker hits to clear this roadblock.

