==Trivia==
*He is a direct reference to the [[wikia:doraemon:Guidance Angel|Guidance Angel]] from ''[[wikipedia:Doraemon|Doraemon]]'', both in appearance and in personality.
*Prior to the [[Enemy Guide]] rework in [[Version 13.3 Update|Version 13.3]], Mr. Angel's trait was referred to as "Angelic" instead of "[[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]]".
**In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], he still retains the old "Angelic" trait and was left unchanged despite of the trait update in [[The Battle Cats Unite!/Patch 1.0.9 Update|Patch 1.0.9]].

